{"product_id":"landscape-wales-compact-edition","title":"Landscape Wales: Compact Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eA pictorial celebration of the glorious natural treasures and landscapes which make up the country of Wales. Featuring spectacular mountains, dramatic coastlines, gentle lowlands, and idyllic river valleys, Landscape Wales also focuses on people and their connection with the natural environment, from those who work the land to those who enjoy its potential for recreation. Now in a compact, travel-friendly size, included within are more than 50 large, high-quality photographs. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:18 x 152  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Terry Stevens \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781910862889 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44898552414361,"sku":"11RD9781910862889","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/5bb2bd5bba318f5b429777e931109b37.jpg?v=1729003173","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/landscape-wales-compact-edition","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}